                        <p class="itemparagraph">The plane lands and comes to a screeching, grinding halt; just short of the edge of the runway. &quot;Wow!&quot; exclaims the pilot, &quot;This must be the shortest runway I've ever landed on!&quot;</p>
                        <p class="itemparagraph">The co-pilot looks left and right and says &quot;Yeah, and about the widest, too...&quot;</p>
